FIND - search for files››Syntax:› FIND [d: | device][path]name[.ext]››Looks for files matching the name›(wildcards allowed) in all directories›of all drives, or only on the given›drive, device (e.g. CAR:) or›directory. Each match is shown with›its full path; hidden files are found›too. The number of matches comes last.››Example:› FIND *.DAT› A:>SUPER.DAT› B:>TESTS>TEST.DAT› 2 matches found››See also: DIR›